처리와 제한 처리" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=34;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="75" width="657.4" height="94" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="같은 사건의 1~5단계 / 본문 §4와 대응 / 시간축은 측정 비율이 아님" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="166" width="759.52" height="35.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="공통 입력과 끝점은 유지한다. 각 칸은 사건 설명이며 Component 또는 process 배치를 뜻하지 않는다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="238" width="1186.06" height="37.05" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="A  공유 권한의 처리 코드" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#195FBD;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="300" width="364.16" height="43.800000000000004" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="1. 선택 문서와 허용 목적 확인" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#195FBD;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="92" y="393" width="422.18" height="42.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" value="Request Controller → [요청] / ← [반환] Policy Manager: 유효 범위 확인" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="92" y="458" width="936.74" height="38" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e16" value="2. 자료 획득" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#195FBD;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="92" y="683" width="182.96" height="42.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e17" value="Context Manager → [요청] / ← [반환] source adapter: read와 근거 반환" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="92" y="748" width="928.0" height="38" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e21" value="3. 의미 해석" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#195FBD;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="92" y="973" width="182.96" height="42.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e22" value="Request Interpreter → [요청] / ← [반환] Model Access: 요청/제안 반환" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="92" y="1038" width="922.48" height="38" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e26" value="4. 현재 제안과 근거 확인" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#195FBD;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="92" y="1263" width="351.44" height="42.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e27" value="Request Controller: 현재 자료/입력/권한 확인" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="92" y="1328" width="580.24" height="38" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e31" value="5. 외부 Agent로 인계" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#195FBD;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="92" y="1553" width="310.4" height="42.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e32" value="Task Manager → Agent Gateway → [요청] / ← [반환] Agent:&lt;br&gt;command/자료" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="92" y="1618" width="770.22" height="70" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e33" value="같은 정상 사건의 흐름. 실패/철회/재시작은 본문 §6.&lt;br&gt;표시/생성 완료와 실제 청취, 접수와 업무 완료를 구별한다.&lt;br&gt;구조의 유리한 조건과 반증은 본문 §8~9에서 검토한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="84" y="1870" width="650.4" height="95.10000000000001" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e34" value="B  Broker와 제한 process" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1312" y="300" width="404.48" height="43.800000000000004" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e37" value="1. 선택 문서와 허용 목적 확인" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="393" width="422.18" height="42.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e38" value="동일 + Request Controller → Data Access Broker: 자료 범위 준비" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="458" width="847.96" height="38" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e42" value="2. 자료 획득" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="683" width="182.96" height="42.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e43" value="제한 client → [요청] / ← [반환] Data Access Broker → [요청] / ←&lt;br&gt;[반환] source: handle과 허용 자료 반환" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="748" width="862.22" height="70" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e47" value="3. 의미 해석" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="973" width="182.96" height="42.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e48" value="제한 Request Interpreter → [요청] / ← [반환] Data Access Broker →&lt;br&gt;[요청] / ← [반환] Model Access" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="1038" width="901.78" height="70" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e52" value="4. 현재 제안과 근거 확인" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="1263" width="351.44" height="42.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e53" value="동일 + Data Access Broker의 실제 발급 근거 대조" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="1328" width="617.5" height="38" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e57" value="5. 외부 Agent로 인계" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#087A53;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="1553" width="310.4" height="42.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e58" value="같은 command + Agent Gateway → [요청] / ← [반환] Data Access&lt;br&gt;Broker: 수신자별 제공" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="1618" width="830.48" height="70" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e59" value="같은 정상 사건의 흐름. 실패/철회/재시작은 본문 §6.&lt;br&gt;표시/생성 완료와 실제 청취, 접수와 업무 완료를 구별한다.&lt;br&gt;구조의 유리한 조건과 반증은 본문 §8~9에서 검토한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1332" y="1870" width="650.4" height="95.10000000000001" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e61" value="검정 = 공통 / 파랑 = A 고유 / 초록 = B 고유 / 색은 우위가 아님" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=19;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2138" width="651.72" height="31.650000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e62" value="실선 → 요청/전달 / 점선 → 반환/확인" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=right;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2149.24" y="2138" width="346.76" height="30.3" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e63" value="제목 상자 = Component / 내부 둥근 상자 = Module / 원통 = 저장 / 접힌 종이 = 자료 / 육각형 = 연동 대상" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=17;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2176" width="962.38" height="28.950000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e64" value="실제 소요 시간/성능을 표시하지 않는다. 요청과 반환의 송수신 책임은 각 단계와 본문 표에 명시한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#5B697B;fontSize=17;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2212" width="856.64" height="28.950000000000003" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
